Our signs have fallen behind. The big map and welcome board by the entrance, and the park rules sign by the playground, both still point people to the old `dartingtonra.com` address rather than [meadowbrookdartington.org](https://meadowbrookdartington.org).

The map board also has a "Groups + Activities" panel with slots that sit empty, so visitors can't see what actually runs here week to week - which is a shame, because plenty does.

**What's involved**

- Redraw the artwork with the current web address, contact details and branding
- Rethink the activities panel so it's easy to keep up to date
- Get quotes for printing and new boards, and fit them

If you do design work and fancy a project with a very visible result, this is a good one to take on.

Cost to be confirmed.
